{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-06-13 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT INTRODUCES FIRST PCI EXPRESS® 6.0 PROTOCOL VALIDATION TOOLS', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #ANALYZER--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS) INTRODUCES THE FIRST PCI EXPRESS® (PCIE®) 6.0 PROTOCOL VALIDATION TOOLS. THE CABLE-FREE PROTOCOL ANALYZER AND PROTOCOL EXERCISER ENABLE SEMICONDUCTOR, COMPUTER, AND PERIPHERAL MAKERS TO PERFORM COMPLETE SILICON CHIP, ROOT COMPLEX, AND ENDPOINT SYSTEM VERIFICATION IN A REAL-TIME DEVELOPMENT ENVIRONMENT. THE PCIE 6.0 SPECIFICATION IS A NEW HIGH-SPEED SERIAL INTERFACE STANDARD RELEASED BY THE PCI-SIG® SUPPORTING THE HIGH.'}